abstract: >-
  Eleven sorting networks for 49 to 62 inputs that are not dominated by any entry in
  Bert Dobbelaere's list of sorting networks (version of 2026-11-20). New size upper bounds:
  n=50 (375 CEs), n=55 (431), n=57 (453), n=58 (464), n=61 (496). New (size, depth) pairs:
  (49,368,20), (57,457,20), (60,487,20), (61,497,21), (61,501,20), (62,510,20).
  Includes exact verifiers (0-1 principle prefix product and SAT), search configs and logs.
